<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav October unemployment rises to 839,855.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav October unemployment rises to 839,855.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV UNEMPLOYMENT   OCT 96	 SEPT 96	OCT 95</p>
<p> number seeking work    839,855	 835,314     784,329</p>
<p> vacancies		   34,979	  30,876	25,961</p>
<p> total employed	 2.065 million  2.066 million 2.104 million</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data do not include private sector.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
